    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c22fe3ba4b90d57b509c9c5e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "昨晚，器材突然故障。\n我花了一整晚的时间尝试修复，\n但我的知识中不存在修复机器的方法──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef4d774664d7291544b952919354c1794e2dfffc15aff2bacc4def82a91ba6ae",
