      "uid": "zhcn:aafd1ce17990ff3c38973586",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我忍着快要昏倒的感觉清楚地告诉她\n“这种情况就该直接回家”并把她送回宿舍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0982048044b659c6d07a3beff0f458320190a4b5d728e3af5221fe4ca0cb0a29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026510.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d017dbef5db106cd09f16b55",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在心里如此发誓。又过了几天后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0a21d84c0c871eeb0582083f78ec07ad33988c0177f6ece5daf42ee3794f02f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026510.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
